WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.940
A traveller on a dusty road
is thrown to the ground.

2
00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:07.390
A light from the sky shines all around.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:11.450
Someone at prayer is certain that
a presence stands beside her.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.700
Yet she sees nothing at all.

5
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:17.470
In the Temple, a prophet
cries out: Woe is me!

6
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.040
I am undone.

7
00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:23.860
A blinding light, a silent
presence, a terror before the holy.

8
00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:26.030
Are these the same experience?

9
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.950
In this mission, you'll sort
religious experiences into types:

10
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.790
visions, conversion and prayer.

11
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:38.460
Then you'll meet Rudolf Otto, who stripped
the word holy down to its raw experience.

12
00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:43.000
Your mission: find out whether these
experiences are one kind or many.
